/**Function*************************************************************

  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap81 watched-parent phase-retention probe.]

  Description [stmap81 reuses stmap80 diagnostics and enables a narrow
  final-pass mapper policy probe: for the configured downstream parent, exact
  or phase-aware area recovery may keep a child-phase-0 candidate when it is
  within a small timing and area-premium window of the current best cut.]

  SideEffects []

  SeeAlso     []

